above says that no run has executed or that a path is unexercised, this paragraph is the later word): run ODV1-42517-5yb0fmgv (debate_results fd0edbff, row saved 22:11 CST 2026-11-24; launch 21:50 CST; engine 2df7f6fa and child aad0ad9c by the write records; openai/gpt-6.2-sol as the Oracle defending against meta/muse-spark-1.3; all eight rounds stored; THE PANEL FAILED at Panel Check on seat hydrogen and NO VERDICT exists; no judgment row and no enforcer row was written; cost 3.8227). The question round's calls are costed: call_costs holds "QR Answer" 3, "QR Answer C openrouter" 3, "QR Follow Ask" 3 and "QR Follow C openrouter" 1, and the dollars of all 42 entries sum to run_cost_usd (3.8227). DEFECT in this run: five entries, all google/gemini-3.8-flash, carry a negative input-token count (field i: Synthesis Call -1, Accept Call -1, Panel Judge 1 -1, QR Ask -75,869, QR Follow Ask -77,682; found by W1, Wall 11923); the dollars are right, the token fields are not. UNEXERCISED or not shown: the resend calls and the Close Group Retry (no such entry; the record does not say whether any was made), and the child's R2 Alt Judge Enforcer Resend (the child was not called). This run is NOT a clean run: the panel failed and nothing after Panel Check ran (ASK 629), so it is not counted as one of the two live runs with no issues. The operator's rule of 10:38 CST 2026-11-24 asks two live runs with no issues; status stays 'read back'.$t$,
